OL,3,GNEWSACall for action at bend where
OL,4,Adrivers keep crashing
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents at a block of flats in Derby
OL,7,Fare calling for measures to make the
OL,8,Froad outside their homes safer after a
OL,9,Fthird car crash in the space of a year.
OL,11,FA white BMW 3 series hit the corner of
OL,12,Fa building on the bend at the top of
OL,13,FThe Hollow in Littleover just after
OL,14,Fmidnight on Sunday 1 November, damaging
OL,15,Fthe outer wall of the building and
OL,16,Fleaving fluids from the engine running
OL,17,Fdown the road.
OL,19,F"I thought we'd been bombed," said
OL,20,Fresident Colleen McCarroll.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
